Z||000000||mrossum||10-31-2001||02:13 AM||||"Why bother?" is the one question in the world that really irritates me in a hurry. "Because" is the answer to that question, by the way. if you don't want to help answer the question, then don't. but please, don't ask "why bother?" we are supposed to be here helping each other, not chastising. if you think a project is a waste, that's fine, but keep it to yourself so we can get along doing it. nothing is more satisfying than to watch someone saying it can't be done, getting interrupted by someone actually doing it....just my 2 cents worth.......................||||reg||11
